# The audit ledger stamps a self-excluding SHA-256 computed over LF-joined content
# (scripts/validate-audit-ledger.mjs). With core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout
# rewrites LF -> CRLF on disk, so the recomputed hash never matches the stamped one
# and the validator fails on a pristine tree. Pin LF for this file so the hash is
# reproducible on every platform.
MINDBOOST_AUDIT_LEDGER.md text eol=lf
